# Note what is deliberately NOT ignored. `fixtures/` contains committed
# lockfiles, a `node_modules`-free `package-lock.json`, `.csproj` files and a
# `pom.xml` — normally build detritus, here the evidence the scanner is tested
# against. `tests/golden/` holds the CLI output the README quotes; regenerating
# it silently would defeat the test that guards it.
